PUBLIC-DOMAIN DATA

Some fields in exercises.json - specifically the exercise ids, muscles, level, mechanic, and
category - derive from free-exercise-db (https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db), which was
released into the public domain.

The CC BY-NC 4.0 licence applies only to our own contributions and does not restrict material that is
already in the public domain.


